From 69234fbe6bcc3ef94f5b19364a4503de1dfd0a36 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Reuben Ninan <reubenninan@yahoo.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 22:27:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Long-press Sleep puts the machine to sleep and exits the
 app

Restores the de1app behaviour: a tap on Sleep still sleeps or wakes the
machine; holding it for 0.8 s sleeps the machine and, once the gateway
accepts the request, calls window.decentApp.exitApp() so the tablet can
be used normally. A long press on "Awake" only wakes, and hosts without
exitApp() just sleep.

